[{"id":"latch-predict-good","itemId":"latch","role":"warmup","promptHtml":"In <code class=\"nobreak\">rgb_select</code>, the first line of the block turns every colour off. Then BTN2 gives red; if it is not pressed, BTN1 gives green; if neither is, BTN0 gives blue. Steps 0 and 1 are drawn for you. Set <code class=\"nobreak\">blue</code> for the rest.","explanationHtml":"<p>Blue is on only while BTN0 is pressed and neither BTN1 nor BTN2 is: steps 1, 4 and 7. In steps 2 and 3 BTN1 is pressed, so green wins; in steps 5 and 6 BTN2 is pressed, so red wins. In every step without blue, the first line has already turned it off, so it never stays on by mistake.</p>","type":"waveform","wave":{"id":"rgb-select","source":"hdl/level-01/rgb_select/rgb_select_tb.sv","timescale":"1ps","period":10000,"periodText":"10 ns","unit":"step","cycles":8,"signals":[{"label":"btn0","path":"rgb_select_tb.btn0","width":1,"role":"signal","changes":[[0,"0"],[1,"1"],[3,"0"],[4,"1"]]},{"label":"btn1","path":"rgb_select_tb.btn1","width":1,"role":"signal","changes":[[0,"0"],[2,"1"],[4,"0"],[6,"1"],[7,"0"]]},{"label":"btn2","path":"rgb_select_tb.btn2","width":1,"role":"signal","changes":[[0,"0"],[5,"1"],[7,"0"]]},{"label":"red","path":"rgb_select_tb.red","width":1,"role":"signal","changes":[[0,"0"],[5,"1"],[7,"0"]]},{"label":"green","path":"rgb_select_tb.green","width":1,"role":"signal","changes":[[0,"0"],[2,"1"],[4,"0"]]},{"label":"blue","path":"rgb_select_tb.blue","width":1,"role":"signal","changes":[[0,"0"],[1,"1"],[2,"0"],[4,"1"],[5,"0"],[7,"1"]],"samples":["0","1","0","0","1","0","0","1"]}]},"answer":"blue","prefill":[0,1]},{"id":"latch-fill-default","itemId":"latch","role":"core","promptHtml":"The first line of the block must turn red, green and blue off before the <code class=\"nobreak\">if</code> lines run. Type the value it gives all three.","explanationHtml":"<p><code class=\"nobreak\">3'b000</code> is three bits, all 0 (lesson 1.3's sized numbers): red gets the first, green the second and blue the third, in the order of the braces. After this line every colour has a value on every path, so no latch can form, and each <code class=\"nobreak\">if</code> only has to turn one colour on.</p>","type":"fill","file":"hdl/level-01/rgb_select/rgb_select.sv","firstLine":1,"totalLines":17,"before":["// The colour of an RGB LED from three buttons: BTN2 gives red; if it is","// not pressed, BTN1 gives green; if neither is, BTN0 gives blue.","module rgb_select (","  input  logic btn0,","  input  logic btn1,","  input  logic btn2,","  output logic red,","  output logic green,","  output logic blue",");","  always_comb begin"],"blankLine":{"left":"    {red, green, blue} = ","right":";  // all off; a line below may turn one on"},"after":["    if (btn2)      red   = 1'b1;","    else if (btn1) green = 1'b1;","    else if (btn0) blue  = 1'b1;","  end","endmodule"],"highlighted":{"before":[[{"text":"// The colour of an RGB LED from three buttons: BTN2 gives red; if it is","color":"var(--code-token-comment)","bold":false}],[{"text":"// not pressed, BTN1 gives green; if neither is, BTN0 gives blue.","color":"var(--code-token-comment)","bold":false}],[{"text":"module","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":true},{"text":" ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"rgb_select","color":"var(--code-token-function)","bold":false},{"text":" (","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false}],[{"text":"  ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"input","color":"var(--code-token-constant)","bold":true},{"text":"  ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"logic","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":true},{"text":" btn0,","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false}],[{"text":"  ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"input","color":"var(--code-token-constant)","bold":true},{"text":"  ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"logic","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":true},{"text":" btn1,","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false}],[{"text":"  ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"input","color":"var(--code-token-constant)","bold":true},{"text":"  ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"logic","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":true},{"text":" btn2,","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false}],[{"text":"  ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"output","color":"var(--code-token-constant)","bold":true},{"text":" ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"logic","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":true},{"text":" red,","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false}],[{"text":"  ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"output","color":"var(--code-token-constant)","bold":true},{"text":" ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"logic","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":true},{"text":" green,","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false}],[{"text":"  ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"output","color":"var(--code-token-constant)","bold":true},{"text":" ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"logic","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":true},{"text":" blue","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false}],[{"text":");","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false}],[{"text":"  ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"always_comb","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":true},{"text":" ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"begin","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":true}]],"blankLine":{"left":[{"text":"    ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"{","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":false},{"text":"red, green, blue","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"}","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":false},{"text":" ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"=","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":false},{"text":" ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false}],"right":[{"text":";  ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"// all off; a line below may turn one on","color":"var(--code-token-comment)","bold":false}]},"after":[[{"text":"    ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"if","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":true},{"text":" (btn2)      red   ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"=","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":false},{"text":" ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"1'b1","color":"var(--code-token-constant)","bold":false},{"text":";","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false}],[{"text":"    ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"else","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":true},{"text":" ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"if","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":true},{"text":" (btn1) green ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"=","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":false},{"text":" ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"1'b1","color":"var(--code-token-constant)","bold":false},{"text":";","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false}],[{"text":"    ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"else","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":true},{"text":" ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"if","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":true},{"text":" (btn0) blue  ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"=","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":false},{"text":" ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"1'b1","color":"var(--code-token-constant)","bold":false},{"text":";","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false}],[{"text":"  ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"end","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":true}],[{"text":"endmodule","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":true}]]},"accept":["3'b000","3'b00","3'b0","3'd0","3'h0","3'o0","'b0","'d0","'h0","'o0","'0","0"],"caseSensitive":false,"blankLabel":"The value for all three colours"},{"id":"latch-predict-follow","itemId":"latch","role":"core","promptHtml":"In <code class=\"nobreak\">peek_bug</code>, an <code class=\"nobreak\">always_comb</code> block sets <code class=\"nobreak\">led</code> to <code class=\"nobreak\">sw</code> while <code class=\"nobreak\">peek</code> is 1, and no line gives <code class=\"nobreak\">led</code> a value while <code class=\"nobreak\">peek</code> is 0. Set <code class=\"nobreak\">led</code> for every step of this simulation.","explanationHtml":"<p>While <code class=\"nobreak\">peek</code> is 1 (steps 0, 1, 4 and 7), <code class=\"nobreak\">led</code> follows <code class=\"nobreak\">sw</code>. While <code class=\"nobreak\">peek</code> is 0, nothing gives <code class=\"nobreak\">led</code> a value, so in simulation it keeps the value it had in the last step with <code class=\"nobreak\">peek</code> at 1: 0 in steps 2 and 3 (from step 1), and 1 in steps 5 and 6 (from step 4), although <code class=\"nobreak\">sw</code> changes. That is a latch, and <code class=\"nobreak\">peek</code> is its enable. A first line that sets <code class=\"nobreak\">led</code> to 0 would make it plain logic again.</p>","type":"waveform","wave":{"id":"peek-hold","source":"hdl/level-01/peek_bug/peek_bug_tb.sv","timescale":"1ps","period":10000,"periodText":"10 ns","unit":"step","cycles":8,"signals":[{"label":"peek","path":"peek_bug_tb.peek","width":1,"role":"signal","changes":[[0,"1"],[2,"0"],[4,"1"],[5,"0"],[7,"1"]]},{"label":"sw","path":"peek_bug_tb.sw","width":1,"role":"signal","changes":[[0,"1"],[1,"0"],[2,"1"],[3,"0"],[4,"1"],[5,"0"],[6,"1"],[7,"0"]]},{"label":"led","path":"peek_bug_tb.led","width":1,"role":"signal","changes":[[0,"1"],[1,"0"],[4,"1"],[7,"0"]],"samples":["1","0","0","0","1","1","1","0"]}]},"answer":"led"},{"id":"latch-find-bug","itemId":"latch","role":"stretch","promptHtml":"This block should pass <code class=\"nobreak\">a</code> when <code class=\"nobreak\">sel</code> is 0, <code class=\"nobreak\">b</code> when <code class=\"nobreak\">sel</code> is 1, and <code class=\"nobreak\">c</code> for every other value of <code class=\"nobreak\">sel</code>. Verilator warns LATCH. Pick the line that is wrong.","explanationHtml":"<p>The last line is an <code>else if</code>, so it gives <code class=\"nobreak\">y</code> a value only when <code class=\"nobreak\">sel</code> is 2. When <code class=\"nobreak\">sel</code> is 3 no line runs, <code class=\"nobreak\">y</code> keeps its old value, and that memory is the latch. As a plain <code class=\"nobreak\">else</code>, the line covers 2 and 3, as the comment asks. Verilator reports the latch at <code>always_comb begin</code>, the start of the block that builds it, not at the line that causes it. A default first line that sets <code class=\"nobreak\">y</code> to <code class=\"nobreak\">c</code> would also remove it: that is lesson 1.4's other fix.</p>","type":"find-bug","file":"hdl/level-01/pick3_bug/pick3_bug.sv","firstLine":1,"lines":[[{"text":"// y is a when sel is 0, b when sel is 1, and c for every other value of","color":"var(--code-token-comment)","bold":false}],[{"text":"// sel.","color":"var(--code-token-comment)","bold":false}],[{"text":"module","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":true},{"text":" ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"pick3_bug","color":"var(--code-token-function)","bold":false},{"text":" (","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false}],[{"text":"  ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"input","color":"var(--code-token-constant)","bold":true},{"text":"  ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"logic","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":true},{"text":" [","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"1","color":"var(--code-token-constant)","bold":false},{"text":":","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":false},{"text":"0","color":"var(--code-token-constant)","bold":false},{"text":"] sel,","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false}],[{"text":"  ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"input","color":"var(--code-token-constant)","bold":true},{"text":"  ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"logic","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":true},{"text":"       a,","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false}],[{"text":"  ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"input","color":"var(--code-token-constant)","bold":true},{"text":"  ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"logic","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":true},{"text":"       b,","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false}],[{"text":"  ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"input","color":"var(--code-token-constant)","bold":true},{"text":"  ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"logic","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":true},{"text":"       c,","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false}],[{"text":"  ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"output","color":"var(--code-token-constant)","bold":true},{"text":" ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"logic","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":true},{"text":"       y","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false}],[{"text":");","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false}],[{"text":"  ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"always_comb","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":true},{"text":" ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"begin","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":true}],[{"text":"    ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"if","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":true},{"text":"      (sel ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"==","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":false},{"text":" ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"2'd0","color":"var(--code-token-constant)","bold":false},{"text":") y ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"=","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":false},{"text":" a;","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false}],[{"text":"    ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"else","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":true},{"text":" ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"if","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":true},{"text":" (sel ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"==","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":false},{"text":" ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"2'd1","color":"var(--code-token-constant)","bold":false},{"text":") y ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"=","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":false},{"text":" b;","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false}],[{"text":"    ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"else","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":true},{"text":" ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"if","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":true},{"text":" (sel ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"==","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":false},{"text":" ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"2'd2","color":"var(--code-token-constant)","bold":false},{"text":") y ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"=","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":false},{"text":" c;","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false}],[{"text":"  ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"end","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":true}],[{"text":"endmodule","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":true}]],"bugLine":13,"fixLine":"else y = c;"},{"id":"latch-predict-hold","itemId":"latch","role":"core","promptHtml":"In <code class=\"nobreak\">pick3_bug</code>, lines give <code class=\"nobreak\">y</code> the value of <code class=\"nobreak\">a</code>, <code class=\"nobreak\">b</code> or <code class=\"nobreak\">c</code> when <code class=\"nobreak\">sel</code> is 0, 1 or 2, and no line gives it a value when <code class=\"nobreak\">sel</code> is 3. Set <code class=\"nobreak\">y</code> for every step of this simulation.","explanationHtml":"<p>In steps with <code class=\"nobreak\">sel</code> 0, 1 or 2, <code class=\"nobreak\">y</code> copies <code class=\"nobreak\">a</code>, <code class=\"nobreak\">b</code> or <code class=\"nobreak\">c</code>. In steps 2, 4 and 6 <code class=\"nobreak\">sel</code> is 3, no line runs, and in simulation <code class=\"nobreak\">y</code> keeps the value of the step before: 0, then 1, then 0. That kept value is the latch. What <code class=\"nobreak\">c</code> does in those steps makes no difference.</p>","type":"waveform","wave":{"id":"pick3-hold","source":"hdl/level-01/pick3_bug/pick3_bug_tb.sv","timescale":"1ps","period":10000,"periodText":"10 ns","unit":"step","cycles":8,"signals":[{"label":"sel[1:0]","path":"pick3_bug_tb.sel","width":2,"role":"signal","changes":[[0,"00"],[1,"01"],[2,"11"],[3,"10"],[4,"11"],[5,"00"],[6,"11"],[7,"01"]]},{"label":"a","path":"pick3_bug_tb.a","width":1,"role":"signal","changes":[[0,"1"],[3,"0"],[6,"1"],[7,"0"]]},{"label":"b","path":"pick3_bug_tb.b","width":1,"role":"signal","changes":[[0,"0"],[3,"1"],[4,"0"],[5,"1"]]},{"label":"c","path":"pick3_bug_tb.c","width":1,"role":"signal","changes":[[0,"0"],[1,"1"],[4,"0"],[6,"1"],[7,"0"]]},{"label":"y","path":"pick3_bug_tb.y","width":1,"role":"signal","changes":[[0,"1"],[1,"0"],[3,"1"],[5,"0"],[7,"1"]],"samples":["1","0","0","1","1","0","0","1"]}]},"answer":"y"},{"id":"latch-choice-why","itemId":"latch","role":"core","promptHtml":"In <code class=\"nobreak\">pick3_bug</code>, no line gives <code class=\"nobreak\">y</code> a value when <code class=\"nobreak\">sel</code> is 3. What must the circuit Vivado builds do then?","explanationHtml":"<p>The block says what <code class=\"nobreak\">y</code> is when <code class=\"nobreak\">sel</code> is 0, 1 or 2, and nothing for 3. The only circuit that matches is one that leaves <code class=\"nobreak\">y</code> as it was, and that needs memory, so Vivado builds a latch and warns (lesson 1.4). Hardware has no starting value for a forgotten case, and no tool reads comments to fill one in.</p>","type":"choice","options":["Keep `y`'s last value, which needs a memory: a latch.","Make `y` 0, like a variable nobody has set.","Pass `c`, as the comment at the top says.","Nothing: Vivado refuses to build a design with a missing value."],"correct":0}]